        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "Police officers are entrusted with significant public power and authority.",
        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "text": "There has been inadequate accountability and consequence for police officers who commit crimes, such as killing unarmed Black or Brown men and women.",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "Banning carotid holds and chokeholds would have prevented George Floyd's death.",
        "confidence": 0.91
