      {
        "text": "The speaker and Joe share aligned values and strategic priorities regarding police reform.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "Unarmed civilians, particularly people of color, are disproportionately targeted and harmed by police violence.",
        "confidence": 0.88
      },
      {
        "text": "Social stability and reduced crime are linked to economic empowerment and housing security.",
        "confidence": 0.87
      },
      {
        "text": "The public expects and deserves transparency and consistency in how accountability is enforced.",
